  "description": "A .NET wrapper library for FFmpeg using FFmpeg.AutoGen. This library provides a managed interface for FFmpeg's raw C API by wrapping around the unsafe pointers and structs provided by FFmpeg.AutoGen. It offers a higher-level, object-oriented approach to access and manipulate FFmpeg's core functionality, making it easier to integrate FFmpeg into .NET applications.\n\nSimplifies working with FFmpeg by providing a safer, managed wrapper around the native FFmpeg API.\n\nExposes FFmpeg's powerful multimedia processing capabilities in a more accessible, object-oriented format.\n\nReduces the need to work directly with pointers and memory management, leveraging the safety of C# for easier debugging and development.\n\nIdeal for .NET developers who need to integrate FFmpeg's audio and video processing, transcoding, streaming, and encoding/decoding capabilities in their applications.",
